# ===== The Empress (Deceiver) =====
@loca EMPRESS_AWAKE_NAME 3 - The Empress: Awakening
@loca EMPRESS_AWAKE_DESC Detonate your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigils</LSTag> during a fight to awaken the Aspect of Love until combat ends. Each goal you reach awakens one more tier.<br><br>Level 3: detonate 3 Sigils to gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_I">Obsession</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 7: detonate 5 Sigils to also gain <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_II">Devotion</LSTag>.<br><br>Level 12: detonate 7 Sigils to awaken as the <LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="Arcana_Passive_Aspect_Empress_III">Aspect of Love</LSTag>.
@loca EMPRESS_I_NAME Obsession
@loca EMPRESS_I_DESC Creatures marked with your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag> have <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Rolls</LSTag> against you.
@loca EMPRESS_II_NAME Devotion
@loca EMPRESS_II_DESC Once per turn, when one of your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigils</LSTag> detonates, the nearest unmarked enemy within [1] of it is marked with a Sigil.
@loca EMPRESS_III_NAME Aspect of Love
@loca EMPRESS_III_DESC Your Charisma increases by [1] and your Arcane spells add your Charisma Modifier to their damage. Once per round, when an enemy attacks you, it must succeed a Wisdom <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throw</LSTag> or its attack is stopped and it is <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag> for 1 turn.
@loca EMPRESS_AWAKENED_NAME 3 - The Empress
@loca EMPRESS_AWAKENED_DESC Awakened as the Aspect of Love until combat ends.
@loca EMPRESS_PROGRESS_NAME Awakening Progress
@loca EMPRESS_PROGRESS_DESC Sigils you have detonated this fight, towards your next Awakening tier.
@loca BELOVED_NAME Beloved
@loca BELOVED_DESC Once per round, when an enemy attacks you, it must succeed a Wisdom <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throw</LSTag> or its attack is stopped and it is <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag> for 1 turn.
@loca HEARTBREAK_NAME Heartbreak
@loca HEARTBREAK_DESC Break every heart that bears your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag>, dealing [1] to each marked creature and detonating the marks at once. Those still standing are <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charmed</LSTag> for 1 turn.
@loca PARANOIA_NAME Paranoia
@loca PARANOIA_DESC Can't take <LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint">reactions</LSTag>.
@loca FERVOUR_NAME Infatuated
@loca FERVOUR_DESC Has <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag> on the next <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Roll</LSTag>.
@loca h358611e4gab01gee5dg782ag87ac7ba30c60 Invade a creature's mind with malicious whispers, imposing <LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage">Disadvantage</LSTag> on its next <LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll">Attack Roll</LSTag>. A creature marked with your <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag> also can't take <LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint">reactions</LSTag>.
@loca hf220ce90g2b6eg3f2cg1707gbbc0a6ea2bd3 Use your <LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint">reaction</LSTag> to <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="CHARMED">Charm</LSTag> an enemy attacking you. They will attack a new target if possible, with <LSTag Tooltip="Advantage">Advantage</LSTag>.

